OL,3,GNEWSANew mental health directory
OL,4,Alaunches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new online directory bringing
OL,7,Ftogether mental health services across
OL,8,FJersey has been launched.
OL,10,FThe Mental Health Directory provides
OL,11,Finformation about a range of services
OL,12,Fdesigned to support islanders' mental
OL,13,Fhealth and wellbeing.
OL,15,FIt aims to help people understand what
OL,16,Fsupport is available, find services
OL,17,Fthat meet their needs and access help
OL,18,Ffor themselves or others, health
OL,19,Fofficials said.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
